I ran into this problem when I started to fiddle around with my
.login, .cshrc, and .dtprofile files.

Digital UNIX seems to be very sensitive to errors in these files
and boot you back into the login screen or prompt whenever there
are some serious errors in said files.

The first problem... an infinite source loop... where my .login sources
