Mime-Version: 1.0
Newsgroups: comp.unix.osf.osf1

Try 
$> cc -g digital.c -L/usr/shlib -lrt

To find library to link, you can use a script like :

#!/bin/ksh
for file in /usr/shlib/* ; do
  echo $file
  nm $file | grep <shm_open | other_function_id>
done

I use this, when I don't know which lib to link.

Good luck...

