> Hi,
> I want to know how to setup my gateway on decunix

As far as I found out today:

  Start Application Manager -> System_Admin -> Configuration -> Network.
  Now select Configure Route Daemon and click onto the Gateways File button.
  Add the following entry:
  Destination Type: Net
  Destination: 255.255.255.0  (it works, but is it correct ?)
  Gateway: -> enter the IP address of your gateway
  Hop Count: 1 (worked for me but you may have to play around with this)
  Route Type: active

After rebooting the machine (routed was not running) everything worked fine
for me (although I am less than sure that these are the correct entries -
may be here is someone who could give us some more infos, e.g. for the
Destination entry).

