Subject: ANNOUNCE: new version of collect (1.09)
Date: 1998/08/26
Message-ID: <6s1kok$u41$1@rtnews.rto.dec.com>#1/1
X-Deja-AN: 385010978
Sender: urban@nasaxp.rto.dec.com
