> > I want to know how to setup my gateway on decunix

> Start Application Manager -> System_Admin -> Configuration -> Network.
> Now select Configure Route Daemon and click onto the Gateways File
>     button.
> Add the following entry:
> Destination Type: Net
> Destination: 255.255.255.0  (it works, but is it correct ?)

This is the hard way. The easy way is:

Start Application Manager -> System_Admin -> Configuration -> Network
Select "Static Routes File" and click "Modify"
Click "default" button, and add the default as the "Gateway Host"
Click okay

that's it. no need to run a routing daemon, which you shouldn't do unless
you absolutely need to for some reason.

