allowing an unlimited number of queues to be connected, each one
with a certain filter (like, ASCII --(a2ps)--> PS --(ghostscript)--> PCL).

Look for the term ``bounce queue'' in the documentation, that's what they
call a queue with a filter which is connected to another queue.

