Sim Thiam Chye wrote:
> 
> How can I dump my OS to a tape drive connected to
> another  digital server? I am using advfs.

Dumping /usr file system from venus to mars. I don't have man pages here, so
ther might be some syntax errors, missed arguments, etc. But here is the basic
idea.

------------

venus:/# vdump -0f - / | rsh mars.your.domain "dd -of /dev/nrmt0h"

or

mars:/# rsh venus.your.domain "vdump -0f - /usr" | dd -of /dev/nrmt0h

Nix.





