StorageWorks RAID arrays we have.  One of the arrays is about three years old,
and although we've upgraded the controller to an HSZ50, the cabinet itself
is not "wide ready", like the newer cabinets for our other two arrays.  Our
technical sales consultant (who used to work for StorageWorks) went to great
pains to make sure we bought narrow drives for the oldest cabinet, though we
bought wide drives for the newer cabinets.

