Like a few other types of log files, the file has to exist before the logging
facility will use it.  This means that

	umask 077
	touch /var/adm/sialog

as root should enable the logging you want.  Please note that it won't be
just su attempts -- it's all SIA events.  This means that on a busy system
it will grow quickly so you'll want to truncate it on a regular basis.

Tim
