Tom,

If the red shadow is there at all resolutions, it sounds more like the
monitor needs setting up. Convergence error may be the wrong description
if it's a Trinitron, but any monitor that's been out of service for some
time will generally need setting up for pincushion, convergence etc.
Most of the Digital monitors have a trimming tool inside if you take the
