Prior to V4.0, you cannot use the cc driver to build shared libraries.
You must call ld directly.  For example: 
	
	ld -shared -no_archive -o my_lib.so a.o b.o c.o -lc

As of V4.0, it's preferrable to use the cc driver to build shared libs.

Joe Mario

